 # Shiny Pokemon
+
+> Local Android sandbox compatibility patch (`1.0.1-sandbox.1`): removes direct `love.filesystem` access; overworld recolor caches are kept in memory and debug diagnostics use the mod logger.
 
 Rolls shiny DVs on new wilds, applies Gen 2 Crystal shiny colors, and draws sparkles in battle and on the overworld (including voxel and follower packs when those mods are present).
 
